  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Developing and establishing an integrated and harmonized national MRV/M&amp;E system for Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the assignment is to design and pilot the national integrated Monitoring, Reporting and Verification (MRV) system and NDC Tracker.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project idea is to design and pilot the national integrated Monitoring, Reporting and Verification (MRV) system and NDC Tracker through updating GHG inventory institutional arrangements, updating and operationalizing the integrated MRV system and implementing NDC tracker.</narrative>
  </description>
